  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting integration opportunity and community resilience for Refugees, Migrants and Host Communities, through actions focusing on the Humanitarian-Development-Peace nexus.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support the sustainable integration of refugees and migrants from Venezuela through the implementation of a comprehensive approach comprising three fundamental pillars: humanitarian assistance, economic empowerment, and social integration in target communities.The project will provide humanitarian assistance to refugee and migrant families through cash assistance for rent processes. It will also promote the socioeconomic integration of refugees, migrants, Colombian returnees, and host communities by strengthening the economic capacities of the beneficiary population. Finally, the project will foster social cohesion and peaceful coexistence in host communities with a high concentration of refugees and migrants.</narrative>
  </description>
